'''{{zone|The Barn}}''' is an island in [[The Farming Islands]] featuring several [[Crops (disambiguation)|crops]] that are not obtainable at the {{zone|Farm}} on the {{Zone|Hub Island}}. It is located to the north-east of the {{Zone|Village}} center, and is reached by using a launchpad at the edge of the island.

{{ZoneText
|Harvest Wheat, Carrots, Potatoes, Pumpkins, and Melons.
|Kill cows, chickens, and pigs.
|Milk cows.
}}

== Features ==
{{Item Display|Carrot!Carrots}}, {{Item Display|Potato!Potatoes}}, {{Item|Wheat}}, {{Item Display|Melon!Melons}} and {{Item Display|Pumpkin!Pumpkins}} grow in various places in The Barn. The Barn also summons {{MobSprite|Cow|alt=Cows}}, {{MobSprite|Pig|alt=Pigs}} and {{MobSprite|Chicken|alt=Chickens}} in the main barn building located at the center of the island and in a pen to its west.

The {{NPCSprite|Farmhand}} is located in the barn building, an NPC that the player will need to talk to for a quest.

A launchpad to the {{Zone|Desert Settlement}} is located on the top of the terraces to the north of the barn building.

